<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>The Library</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --paper: #f5eddd;
      --ink: #30251d;
      --wood: #35241b;
      --brass: #edcca0;
      --rule: #bda88d;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 1.1rem/1.65 Georgia, serif;
    }

    .masthead {
      padding: 2.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      background: var(--wood);
      color: var(--paper);
      border-bottom: 4px solid #a27e51;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    h1 {
      margin-bottom: .4rem;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: normal;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .masthead p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--brass); }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 15rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      max-width: 72rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      min-height: 70vh;
    }

    nav {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      background: #e9dcc6;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    nav h2, .category {
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
      font: 700 .8rem/1.4 system-ui, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    nav ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    a { color: #633c2b; text-underline-offset: .2em; }

    article { padding: 2rem clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
    article h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.15; }
    section { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 1rem; }
    section + section { margin-top: 1.5rem; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      nav { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="masthead">
    <h1>The Library</h1>
    <p>Notes on sociological theory and research</p>
  </header>

  <main class="layout">
    <nav aria-labelledby="catalog">
      <h2 id="catalog">Catalog</h2>
      <strong>Theories</strong>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#rational-choice">Rational Choice Theory</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <article id="rational-choice">
      <p class="category">Theories</p>
      <h2>Rational Choice Theory</h2>

      <section>
        <h3>Overview</h3>
        <p>Add your definition of rational choice theory here.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Key Concepts</h3>
        <p>Add the concepts you want to explain and compare.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Reading Notes</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Paternoster (1989), <cite>Absolute and Restrictive
            Deterrence in a Panel of Youth</cite></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
